{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10017_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca0aeea9eeb1790a630774ee954c59d68206b50904422607475782d4b87ab902",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23867bfda448ba33d48d97d07cfc8ffa42d162fe7fdbb231ee57949a8635f4b5",
      "text": "The feelings of giving are…",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d22807c3fb071c8df788e5cb46407bcda3ae1e542eef69337aaa85c0f1b62012",
      "text": "圭、恭二、夏来、百百人4人接到了\n情人节时期的工作。\n听说要负责以“单相思”为主题的广告与歌曲，\n大家翻开女性杂志的恋爱专题页，\n试图加深对这一主题的理解，然而……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23867bfda448ba33d48d97d07cfc8ffa42d162fe7fdbb231ee57949a8635f4b5",
      "text": "The feelings of giving are…",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9ac6d22b4a19503b695a9265a12e507a141836848945b6a3674245ede5de354",
      "text": "“致●●●●●●●●●●P酱。\n工作辛苦了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5923468e3ca00e76fe32f20ab73710e04e304b9bcd48ba2a7dd91be7f5b59d54",
      "text": "“谢谢你一直以来支持着我们。\n多亏了P酱，我每天才能这么努力”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93f4abcab97c8b8327c9614e96b2dfe3d7dafb6aec2749ff2bbb88e11aa87731",
      "text": "“今天难得是情人节”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000037:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7ea783b4786b1f89d5de9d40ba80cd399bfc740d1d66622ad26929b4f48d19",
      "text": "百百人的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1069bd3c8e0f65ada4505b9255b6fe40b27c167e0e1ce65d72315ba51677fefa",
      "text": "………不对，不是这样。……这个也不行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e41e42c69490b68516094fe54729223aacc86e1c29b1fb4e18fd4933670f69fc",
      "text": "（唉……明明想为P酱准备巧克力和\n留言卡的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a503301214f031d2e149c58c12ebc53ee00e2fbb4ddec901a7db2379f2d814eb",
      "text": "……写了又写，怎么写都不满意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65b573c2ebf2885352ee21d729632da04ef811f90888124924312b12a2a48656",
      "text": "（因为……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e3c8513cf1333b939fc49539aa0671013bb238c5551a424afb26ccde7b69200",
      "text": "（我对你的心意……\n究竟该用什么样的语言来表达，我完全不知道啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6190d9c8853f974190394f890db6e00c88a6d745ca6a294d656ad36a60c7c9",
      "text": "辛苦各位了！\n大家收到了新工作的邀约哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d9ff8f1407b3228c46da65ff1c2f294c925a620cb38650d2f33c33f28f9114c",
      "text": "我们4个……？感觉是挺罕见的阵容啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab784eef36c3d2f9deddd1d05d5fe812823328bcc9fb35bf17bf1471d4fd13f3",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●P酱，是什么样的工作呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7c15d6a18baf4d0ef6b21eb8beb6c2987a06d15bcb40cd2e18ffeba983face6",
      "text": "是关于马上就要到来的情人节的\n工作。我现在把资料发给大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9da6ac00989d50b4180acd05ed0d7a1944adcd91f73942a189a1ddea8db7107c",
      "text": "情人节限定的广告出演……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d615123feaa8999b258e2d6440e30958acbbc81c07c9ceb6776571e0f19c958a",
      "text": "这个，是微电影风格的啊。\n而且……还要负责演唱主题曲吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fed171901924028dc2ab1ad09f8494ba009d891004770bd5febfbf5f3815408d",
      "text": "是的！这份就是歌曲的资料。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7825dabc8da2044a6b093d73e665fe60cec82a4149bacdd0f11f72f1dbad1161",
      "text": "听说是一首从女性视角描绘的、\n令人心焦的单相思之歌哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:337a693ada7dbe585df72f7aa0aa40a7e334c8c658019a3aa80a77e528776a91",
      "text": "真的呢……停留在单相思的状态，就结束了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b2be724eda23d904b82118b7dfeaded5bd54d4f2783267f7d29ab339f61a3e2",
      "text": "这份恋情的结果，不知道吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04188aa1f9a6fa4276fb5e2cf1bf73ac89b4b7672f4faa4b7a2635ac3dd9a3da",
      "text": "负责人说：“在白色情人节发行的\n歌曲中，就会揭晓结果了！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa77b6416a92a7f7049893d357fbb2c144d74d4d500f3af7ec4af75c794ce984",
      "text": "那就是说，在听到那首歌之前，\n我们和客人的小鹿乱撞都会一直持续下去呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d52ee74acc0081f27f176ef93c914d0bce35b9b5c653107b701dd327403571d",
      "text": "广告的内容是……\n“主人公向对方倾诉凄苦的单相思”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d92851bab39fccc0de207b17f909e0e88ca08a71a158aad3f1c01cb71174ba8",
      "text": "广告和歌曲，与其说是恋爱，\n不如说是以单相思为主题啊……感觉好难啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9d71ce3a15d5330a082c4fe3088a53ecc85e05227639b43dfc6c15d57dd7a8e",
      "text": "（但是……我想试一试）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:074d0cb658e155d03f891cd4809ce29f48f4fd7df22538b4c8f014d465994bb3",
      "text": "（这段歌词，和我好像。抱着自己的心意，\n停在原地不知道该如何是好……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31373121c391457e77ee0c5f938a89c11967a392e1e9799999f52c081292e141",
      "text": "（这首歌……我想用声音把它唱出来）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b991d903a95ed2c0cec467b585e4a98763fbbf33f34cae03cafb195e428454c",
      "text": "虽然感觉很难……但我想试一试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5f8a966350daaed7af09442ab796aab3267f25797ef771426895eb0c2ff6fe8",
      "text": "恋爱的话题……我不太擅长。\n不知道能不能做好。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:234660ac53a8ac472e3dce4b1066a637c28ffa9b1102ddf98678f5711929e679",
      "text": "为了……那些支持我的人。\n我想要……变得能够去完成新的尝试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b3e27a778965083c4d2ef59237e76b66e746f521253357362d25ee17a9de669",
      "text": "……一定没问题的。\n这次也有●●●●プロデューサー在身边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95e1c6337fd1ffb9d93f5d038a8d022fa5dfa40e65f639735bc8521cbc2bcebf",
      "text": "无论遇到多么艰难的事情，\n都一定会很有耐心地支持我们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64f6adaa514d8b744a863abd833ced8449a8ddcea9166d30b9bb344041103da7",
      "text": "哈哈……也是呢。●●●●プロデューサー，\n不好意思，这次也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c97819649a76d7e697c2292419423699860c0e448ec2cc2e48e4a30d7ced6626",
      "text": "百百人……？\n商讨已经结束了哦……不回去吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0d619eb21c95d16e2b65e0cdc7b2bb19bc6b0e6f54561bb023d6a5d997aac8c",
      "text": "啊，嗯。我想把今天拿到的资料\n再多研读一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:085ec63a35c692588855ad408bbaf3f0e77567d160c49402382ac1f2bbd51a3d",
      "text": "……这样啊。那我也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19431efc53d76c4ae1a8b4eba5a4979972a5b1bf49fa77eb477749a990c7847c",
      "text": "刚才的榊君，好帅气啊。\n明明不擅长，却还是想去尝试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a80f6dc5ee18c2f090692ac97310e5c0a34e78d5024f9ad82ed9a87d3032dd1a",
      "text": "百百人……擅长恋爱话题吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6407b21d5ef577df4b0e1a714a3d3e944e0008e723f7afeab925dcc128f0d1f5",
      "text": "没有啦。我也算不上擅长哦。\n因为没什么经验嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3fa84133cc7bc5c911601cc1c661725990d44ce93c12dbcf60068d1add9b213",
      "text": "……榊君为什么会不擅长呢？\n该不会……是有喜欢的人了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4a5b7072b2e0665dd673d88aa35a14bc03be67758c93f0005ef5ac60d550696",
      "text": "嗯……\n不过我觉得，和恋爱可能有点不太一样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:279cb46e050fc6521aa035a9dc8602535f965edd6abaa8508b442e0960cbe7a6",
      "text": "我有一个……一直觉得非常重要的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a18507e074231d7a008cf9a1f2fedcf049a5a0465db37c36f0103393b1bfec4d",
      "text": "为了那个人的话……我什么都愿意做。\n只要那个人能幸福……我就会觉得开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abe18d8536f56f38f231fb459cadc6ca2775afb7a62431ebeee12f17b82a29e5",
      "text": "（……你也能够这么直率地\n用语言表达出来啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab8ec0f801ae8c3fb39f2beacb1eff7bd505f33245502ba5bf8ee8af460b8b07",
      "text": "（在这家事务所里的……全都是坚强的人啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000024:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52318f915dbdbbe9eec64a6f77cdf85a74e5daed88807a4a80b9b5218f40dffd",
      "text": "“怎样才能向喜欢的人告白？”\n这边是……“最近比起他，更沉迷于工作了”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccea2c3c516293349eead66e46ac8f672b0bacca833c399bdfd8968d95ae959d",
      "text": "即使同是恋爱的烦恼……也有各种各样的形式呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d1e50a1d38282301d3270b5949dc22d190bbce6c5f4e9c9b31b7049bd3396d3",
      "text": "啊……\n这本杂志……也在做恋爱专题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:010e629c3a9bb4328c25776a6183b5552ef3f8a838d5a0c5d506d72246451a97",
      "text": "“正式交往前的时期，\n是最开心也最让人心跳加速的”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7a1d0d9e86151fb5b021d6750a5d71af6377dbae56b6fa029d6d21618d88e3e",
      "text": "这个，我以前一起打工的同伴\n也说过差不多的话呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:874bff27ff3d6f3735d9687e377a25875e73fa43d72f3a49269ed89f2fdcc56f",
      "text": "哎，真的吗？\n我记得我同班同学好像也说过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a68db8299f186ec7b245c9b602b9c7835c93eebc766009ae56fbd9d57484b66c",
      "text": "大家……都喜欢心跳加速的感觉，吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9303ad98111b7dc25dac08db6ca80f9021a818350d878cae5d49196a14f73f72",
      "text": "呵呵。要是那样的话，女孩子的心脏可真坚强呢。\n……啊，这次再来看看这本女性杂志吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8350f1d3e00e07d652bf1f4525e9209ba88ab3542e9cc3a8fce560ff7cd0555d",
      "text": "（……听说是以“女性视角”和“单相思”为\n主题，本来还在想该怎么办才好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05756f724d4ad04eddd98f0929c53cb72005d4ac62200e7cce05edb7e2d5f24f",
      "text": "（这里的杂志倒是个不错的切入点。\n之后要向帮我们准备的制作人道个谢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_e:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cc586147c8f932da840943ac5110ad3a8ff6e41550c3966fd1b892b06611978",
      "text": "……圭先生。\n那边那本杂志上写了什么……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a570da431b014f0532920d87754b87755198805f227f87177624554e247170a5",
      "text": "“希望男朋友在穿搭上能多花点心思”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8443b30a0725fc5d32a8592fddb529db78989beae6fbc813935d70d30553c8f4",
      "text": "喜欢的人穿什么，真的会那么介意吗？\n我倒是觉得，穿不穿都无所谓就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:555181c8d91e4cb93b158f0ec738ee1ebeea751c6d744168e7d5f60442e73b70",
      "text": "榊、榊。这上面写的，\n是不是也适用于你啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:355a2227c7ebd1a559fe4d4b9b6edd57f4d382e3cb6fe683d05574e1b3b4fe3e",
      "text": "啊……嗯。这个我也能理解……\n“聊LINK聊到深夜，比什么都开心”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b33007d86ccbc9ed99b08ef179be7fea5ff8fa9cb40422875c8fdc4c8fb3a10f",
      "text": "我也觉得……和High×Joker的大家，\n到了晚上还能聊天……很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a8ad500fe71798e07db35b0d1b44ead236a39c72334471330b271e289ecc94f",
      "text": "就是说啊。High×Joker的感情确实很好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:857e480887a7d39d2ffd2549e028a9b5ba21dc3b5636339433205ec9dae0c5f9",
      "text": "（总、总觉得气氛有点尴尬，一时冲动就搭话了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2ed7c4dd2c8970428b8f85f3f1ebb18af2b06df5fca882a3d591746a04c1867",
      "text": "（本来发着呆觉得按这节奏应该没问题，\n但聚在这里的阵容……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fd7b7537da76157622200aad8bf1796efac98d7ec7eab68047618ecc12a082e",
      "text": "（全都是慢热飘忽型的啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dae5ac9b2cc8c50f28e6c98259a8b7f341c394dac4c1a15be5d4411c84f3b84",
      "text": "（榊和花园还只是高中生。\n都筑先生则是……浑身是谜，搞不太懂）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7509279d0a228d000ec6aa17d1a29b62da2298f7e3f777dcc3340aa1dd7d3ede",
      "text": "（难不成，我不站出来带头就不行了吗……？\n说起来在Beit的时候，基本都是实先生在……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_f:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998ae0176332896f2d591e274fd4002d4a01756c60644184f87208d9779af506",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e15dc29d2718bc4e4f8e42188c961c37370f914bff08a11534ff76dddb041e8",
      "text": "“一想到喜欢的人，在夜里也会睡不着”……吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:354063e1b0356f180b80caae0f4b3a6f8e631c4be52cec98ee6dc9e5c82f168a",
      "text": "厉害啊，能为某样事物沉迷到这种地步。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:758d9c2b362e50499ec0ffa10b94dcbdcc3d4a0c31ffe631cdb4fe6d9f90722b",
      "text": "……恭二先生没有过这种经历吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e5edd75b82f51842d8933e721198d9ba869c4dec8405f18b24990e4406758f2",
      "text": "我啊……也是呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ba978d32c355157be95ffe034139b3ce6bc12dfca5796b332ac0e7fefba57e6",
      "text": "（脑海中一下子浮现出的，是在那个家里时的自己）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:413710a3d474536733fab20c11e9f77150f7216110679f9e222622d6110ccd03",
      "text": "（那时候老爸和大哥以“为了鹰城家”为由，\n硬给我灌输了那么多无聊的东西）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:864944d26512b3131e936c3ce4eee90903dd5595a7c34180b880c0ef00075f24",
      "text": "（……每天都在拼命硬撑着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf4ee1544d0d0862d3d6ed205d8df7e10b24b1772de4f3f343b10eab434fa385",
      "text": "……比起沉迷，我倒是经历过拼命挣扎的时期。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73e01be47b5ecfd979b334e7203bd764e7ca4eed6357b1b82549af344289c5ca",
      "text": "而且最后什么成果都没拿出来……\n有一阵子，我为此消沉堕落了相当长的时间呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1fd0172f9db7958ccc23199e0c9821a7572362f8a559162135b945ff3607445",
      "text": "不过现在，在这里……我找到了自己真正\n能够沉迷进去的事物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_g:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ca7881a0d77795fc65de6d30c90730266935e2dd3ccd32ac9ac206656564f90",
      "text": "也许我也快要像这个人一样，\n变得夜不能寐了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf96658c6791afa6d28acdcc31150d2b6d763ca337bbd401d47d70575d48cc74",
      "text": "（但是，就算沉迷进去，要是最后又……\n什么都没有得到的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27e8ccc5c2f592443ae0d54406190413f1b8174cb4e203b923c81e7f3f550270",
      "text": "……花园，你没事吧？\n抱歉，我说了奇怪的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:186d10a24f150d70c8726379a88891568e6697ae2159fe1f6f313d85791e3864",
      "text": "啊……啊哈哈，对不起。\n我只是在想，我也和鹰城先生一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8154f3450c787399bda9a7454a2814aa7f759754aa1740fe4c33ac5e519e786f",
      "text": "我也是来到这里之后……得到了很多很多东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf41c9420ded54bfc2030ab58e59fdcf0413a7bd634e96fcf5335a110a1d833a",
      "text": "甚至多到让我觉得，\n可以试着再次按照自己的想法走走看……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64a0321ec6cf7469872ae118f7f72b9f89c312adc568d092ffe342778c23ca58",
      "text": "（比如想试着去唱让自己心动的歌曲）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1c159d5a26c2d7b889201ee151bf02ae010821151713ad987544325971e6fcc",
      "text": "（比如想把难以言表的心情，\n传达给P酱之类……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9942ddaa2633fd4e9867496abd8c190e1e15261bbbadee9da4bee0d40bc141aa",
      "text": "但是……每当想要去做些什么的时候，我就会忍不住去想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93319e313726071716ec1bf3cd83101f6470c1079981ae838f660cb3d730a3c1",
      "text": "万一这会让谁失望、\n或者给别人添麻烦的话，该怎么办……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ad5b8529c6b755d4becd94db3b66e27c63827fd4206d1d51b8079d30df46eca",
      "text": "如果会变成那样的话……\n是不是把自己的心情抹掉反而比较好呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f129e590c4b82adb8aebb9378e9651bd702cee0f6dfda7a785f7dbe69a0e2e0",
      "text": "……我倒不这么认为呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7185b32ce7fdf73730f8b4b9e5ec49c48944213c5fdac832c687921638b32cd",
      "text": "因为……心底诞生了某种感情，\n这件事本身，我认为就足够美好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5310a0b49574e6fee8c08b810e125df70143f511591067ff823d87616dd9a41",
      "text": "喜悦、悲伤、感动、愤怒……\n心中无法诞生任何感情的人类，和死人没有任何分别。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27ce19c49067f16c8a241907ea2e5925096fb2994c46f9bf38e1811d24dfe667",
      "text": "比起那种寂静，\n我更想侧耳倾听心灵泛起涟漪的奇迹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ea9a4a09f3e4be4d7a37588f5ae5e336822ba130421b9e6e5f8eb20cba64fc0",
      "text": "……我们拿到的这首歌，\n也是将那样的奇迹化作了音符呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a5020b089859328f693f150055bcaa3d1cea28a093a146478e00b82a54b673c",
      "text": "……嗯。无论看多少次资料，\n都觉得这是一首凄楚、脆弱……而又美丽动人的歌呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1c4dc353c08255a1e35b0a06b9a3a66281a5553ecd51e5b9be97d8794c01867",
      "text": "真想快点唱唱看啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92f7672fa34f611cbb3cc6a32f43d695ba66a000d25dbb0400c9dff0aae776c4",
      "text": "我也……是这么想的。\n从刚拿到这首歌的时候起……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a75931fc730ac2a1f64d6a6015b0c4319dcd6ec239ebcf16b67ad793707e182",
      "text": "……花园。不用去管对方会有什么反应。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0c64046ab9d1e1976e2f67f600bf3192412dd40f85afe677436ad06088dac3",
      "text": "就算那件事对某些人来说不太方便……\n但能有想做的事情，本身就是一件好事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bacdf5d87ea44a462ef5ff9fd408a0c9d26f5e31c1007f1f88f16979f21745c",
      "text": "那些想做的事，不正是\n你想活出自我、活得像自己的证明吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000124:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c3bc141883a8077caeb0c7ef9c96d81f51d04ac3d44279a28e036a1213a9b6d",
      "text": "商讨辛苦了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000126:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba6d317ce3a2bfaf3d87ba426113b0a3498828395ba8d093265eb3539b78c491",
      "text": "辛苦了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000128:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d6887ba228df48903dd9c7791b34690f9d734631ddaed6dd8c95555f5caf53c",
      "text": "明天就是广告拍摄了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000130:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28581383e7a4cbb59273f2332b7f0d84ada61a975e6edb936ce4ce2822d04f67",
      "text": "多亏了连日的商讨，\n我觉得自己差不多\n找到感觉了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000132:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f322ccb18242bb0096e168d90a7eec0d5bb1bae38e1e01a6a3f1c269fe6afe0",
      "text": "花园和榊还跟得上吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000134:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a81e0a33413df2a0f3cbc6d22896765357a0aaa9011660e141273cbb5744722",
      "text": "我在和大家聊过之后，\n觉得思念重要之人的心情\n都是一样的，所以，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000136:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd7a574a1966c6641543b20996f7b7e37e0cb82cbbbdc56559976147b8791ff9",
      "text": "没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000138:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bb5ca6503124514cdea240af4c5c5fdb3a2c1a5782f2e3ada6bdfa55238182e",
      "text": "我也没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000140:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cadccf915d80cc449e368a745cf9a20f5aaa73e0b1d36f6ce6c9d2526b78822",
      "text": "多亏了大家，\n感觉能够好好努力了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000144:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:989251b2d20b5ec1917b545d6c6d3e26acfb759a65c59dff4cefa2dcf519616c",
      "text": "<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000146:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e66e258e17d7f0fc99d1d2203d4a73eeeba63a6ed790634a948352779b8bb224",
      "text": "<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000148:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:838ead6adab65e08078277f14e512b8a281ff0e67cdff2320fc6024d0fc6b2fe",
      "text": "绘画出来",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000150:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2abb7c918c0c4fe404a002b50b40c41d5278e0bb4fcd69a84c6e5ffbbbbf8578",
      "text": "都筑先生，这是……？\n什么意思啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ab1102babc1298c890650e808961091c3646ca7d54e2dc5d290de42873134ca",
      "text": "喂，辛苦了。\n想着稍微找你聊两句。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a917777ed7982a8ebb02bb6c6770f5ae5a27e10579d0b30264ff70cb1dc3f55",
      "text": "关于这次的工作啊……分在一起的成员，\n要么年纪比我小，要么就是哪里迷迷糊糊的对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44550637dfbea039c0fa33c9fbe97c77fcd9e7d5bf466f9dcbf838d711bc4ff3",
      "text": "所以和在Beit的时候完全不一样啊。\n啊，我是指好的方面……受到了不少启发。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b69ae20df9485786658c8f844e39cc7b2e455bc095ac76c59bec1f4cb341d6d",
      "text": "我也试着用自己的方式去照顾大家、统领大家了……\n但不知道自己做得好不好啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:269ac3b7fd40f2ec117f97a60bba14e6b2cd547e6c4a47d097f72b99d197cf88",
      "text": "平时总是能自然而然把大家凝聚起来的实先生，\n原来真的很厉害啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000038:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5f1eaf6f7b4234bdbe8ecd68ee8d9442112baef2b4e15411585db8547c4142d",
      "text": "恭二先生也\n很可靠哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000041:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0e74a67cd885f9c419cc67391b517ddb8c895542d62e16aff3eb3d7f0a4458d",
      "text": "是吗？\n既然你都这么说了，那或许真的是这样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000043:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b102879c8960b5e66e8175db2d90de904b9838257d9fed3abfde95690b4383c",
      "text": "不过，下次为了能做得更好，我会继续努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000045:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01fc425ad78b67180b5546b0241906714ba4aba1120d8473e30ccabcac1610ab",
      "text": "那么，下次碰头时再见了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000058:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b444bafc68f25659e0fe320c39e2d36bb20fec3d49c513abdf3aad9b9d42394",
      "text": "广告拍摄当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d81781a5c716d6b99ece6313ca0fe5daf8ea4bb1af8937b66c1865a592411d9e",
      "text": "“情人节快乐。\n我拼尽全力的心意……希望能被你收下”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1744c00d67caa342506c5bad14a858b293e1561264759c919e9e2de03f175378",
      "text": "“这个，送给你……\n即使是无法实现的恋情，也想传达给你……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad3a8df60c2d30d15754185a7384f36da5aecf273c97b2854790109b7f1a7dcf",
      "text": "“今天，是情人节吧？\n别跟我这种人一起过啊……会让我产生误会的”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65efec64da45501d22b73f66c849152ec6879f497071fe54f12dd6dbcaf5134c",
      "text": "“这份巧克力，是我的心意。\n哪怕只有一小块能够传达给你，我也很开心”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc68adc7197afa017b6d0ace39cc9ab96477d0fd0c62c74458411570bb0d173e",
      "text": "“即使无法传达给重要的你”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93d26642c10b603b4b1cc6d45ea46dd02a6aa38711cb1542c55281f27b6c2919",
      "text": "“这份甜蜜，也将慰藉我的心”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2229d1264d9fd03dd47383bcc8659d6bbdb3ae04ec36c3ba58571d3d82618b4c",
      "text": "“……短剧完整版\n正在本网站公开中！此外，在限定期间内……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_k:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7db364eb9a32710e78d3de521a25a39a23685a0231e9e5292750dc941d732e4",
      "text": "情人节当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_k:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6891fe850f8cf92ebb3427e8ca93e3711883c2350cb007109adb576d8fc6bdc",
      "text": "辛苦了……咦。\nP酱不在啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_k:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:802599cd5a687dc8a3781f70b268e7a32f9278d12b73349a17b39edca2f019b6",
      "text": "（我记得白板上有写行程安排吧。\n……这样啊，开完会直接下班回去了啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_k:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:516e7ab18365037da10a9cbc5bf012704c814b9ea62111eef14e844d197c3ac5",
      "text": "（……虽然很想当面送出去，不过还是放在桌上吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_k:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8103bc85d65476591ece9d4d653e220d7750b6dc9ddfcdf4d3b66a3f582d142",
      "text": "（那个，P酱。\n一直以来为了我们，谢谢你）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_k:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa5cd62dd5768c17357180c94235cfbcb7e514b25fed64a7770a4e66bf96eaf8",
      "text": "（单凭这点巧克力和卡片，根本算不上什么回礼……\n可能还会让你感到为难）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_k:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6de21e0295be89bf7b92194a91ecedae28fd6eb948d92fafb7ea7349954892e4",
      "text": "（……但是，多亏了你给予我的一切）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_k:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46db862f247e62f8dab001ad9f7572f196e959537b1c4a0a20e0662229bafaa4",
      "text": "（在我的心中……渐渐滋生出了\n好好珍惜自己、这样任性的感情）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_k:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aeaa8a91aba282bcd21a727557a16549f9189e8b6ddcad353185a184831c750",
      "text": "结果，我还是没能很好地找到\n可以表达对你心意的言语……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_k:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851b608a05f17d2561e9316a4d9453ca31b271fe0abffa52f20f83d8ee247dda",
      "text": "但留言卡，我就直接送给你了哦。\n……对不起哦，P酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
